<title>FRANCE: Cap Gemini H1 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Cap Gemini H1 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end June, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			     220  vs		84</p>
<p>    Operating					670  vs	     406</p>
<p>    Turnover				     9,320  vs	   6,678</p>
<p>NOTE - Cap Gemini gave the figures in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
